          doctorTip: "If new to fasting, start with 12:12 for 3 days, then progress to 14:10, then 16:8. The ghrelin wave passes in 20 minutes — ride it out with hot tea. Ghrelin (hunger hormone) peaks at *habitual meal times* — it's a learned anticipatory signal, not a true energy deficit. When you feel the hunger wave at your old breakfast time, drink 300ml hot green tea + 1/4 tsp salt. The wave crests and passes. Your body learns the new schedule in 7-14 days. Persistence through the adaptation period is the only way."
